===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|donresdach|lang=dum}}, {{term|donredach|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{recons|thonaresdag|lang=odt}}, from late {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{recons|Þunras dagaz||day of Thor|lang=gem-pro}}. Compare Low German {{term|Dunnersdag|lang=nds}}, German {{term|Donnerstag|lang=de}}, West Frisian {{term|tongersdei|lang=fy}}, English {{term|Thursday|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|torsdag|lang=da}}.

